Subject: Separate exit analysis from AOT selection

Add an interpret_only emission policy. Preserve normal exact exit proofs,
keep all variants and mirrors interpreted, and reject legacy emission that
cannot honor the policy. Verify both analyzers and cache invalidation.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>

